E1C2                             ; ")" ( flag -- ): true jumps back to the block start (and keeps it); false
E1C2                             ; drops it and carries on. It uses "]"s code, entered past its SEC: with the
E1C2                             ; carry clear, as it is here, the address popped is pushed back.
