E2BA   0A                     ASL      
E2BB   0A                     ASL      
E2BC   0A                     ASL      
E2BD   85 04                  STA   T0   
E2BF   20 58 E4               JSR   rdhex   
E2C2   B0 0C                  BCS   hx2   ; odd digit: already consumed, dropped
E2C4   05 04                  ORA   T0   
