E2DE   E8                     INX      
E2DF   6C 04 00               JMP   (T0)   
E2E2                             ; ---- "_" is the last handler: its body may leave the page
E2E2                             ; "_" ( n -- addr ): the heap top moves by n, which is signed: a negative
E2E2                             ; count releases. TOS becomes the old top. (The carry is clear on the way in.)
E2E2                          IF   1-CHECKED   
E2E2   AD 7C 04     H_ALLOC:   LDA   HEAP   
E2E5   A8                     TAY      
E2E6   75 00                  ADC   0,X   
E2E8   8D 7C 04               STA   HEAP   
E2EB   94 00                  STY   0,X   
E2ED   AD 7D 04               LDA   HEAP+1   
E2F0   A8                     TAY      
E2F1   75 01                  ADC   1,X   
E2F3   8D 7D 04               STA   HEAP+1   
E2F6   94 01                  STY   1,X   
E2F8   60                     RTS      
